{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35706","headline":"春宫词 · 李咸用","name":"春宫词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风和气淑宫殿春，感阳体解思君恩。\n眼光滴滴心振振，重瞳不转忧生民，女当爲妾男当臣。\n男力百岁在，女色片时新。\n用不用，唯一人。\n敢放天宠私微身，六宫万国教谁宾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}